    "Scan of the 1964 edition of the Mayport, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1948; aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1964; photo revised in 1982; last revised in 1982; printed in 1982.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
